17:12:33 said  ### How Boardy Makes Its API Calls
17:12:34 said  Boardy’s frontend is a modern single-page / multi-page web application that communicates with its backend and third-party services using standard browser **`fetch()`** requests.
17:12:34 said  The site relies on two core first-party endpoints, along with an external calendar booking service and analytics tracking:
17:12:34 said  ---
17:12:34 said  ### 1. User Onboarding Flow: `POST /api/onboard/text`
17:12:34 said  When a visitor clicks **"Message me"** or **"Message Boardy"** and fills out their email, phone number, and optional note, the client initiates the onboarding request.
17:12:34 said  * **Trigger**: Triggered by submitting the hero/dialog form in the onboarding modal (`landing-message-dialog-CIclDkIa.js`).
17:12:34 said  * **Request Method & Headers**:
17:12:35 said  * `POST /api/onboard/text`
17:12:35 said  * `Content-Type: application/json`
17:12:35 said  * **Timeout & Abort Handling**: The browser sets a **40-second timeout** via `AbortSignal.timeout(40000)`. If the request takes longer, the client aborts and presents a retry state.
17:12:35 said  * **Payload Structure**:
17:12:35 said  ```json
17:12:35 said  {
17:12:35 said  "email": "user@example.com",
17:12:36 said  "phone": "+14155552671",
17:12:36 said  "website": "",
17:12:36 said  "landingPageId": "home",
17:12:36 said  "message": "Hey Boardy, I'm looking for introductions to Series A investors.",
17:12:36 said  "utmData": {
17:12:36 said  "utm_source": "google",
17:12:36 said  "utm_medium": "cpc",
17:12:36 said  "utm_campaign": "search_brand",
17:12:36 said  "landing_page": "home",
17:12:36 said  "submitted_at": "2026-11-21T17:00:00.000Z"
17:12:36 said  },
17:12:36 said  "fields": {
17:12:36 said  "onboardingIntent": "fundraising",
17:12:37 said  "calendarProvider": "google"
17:12:37 said  }
17:12:37 said  }
17:12:37 said  ```
17:12:37 said  * *Honeypot protection*: The `website` field is left intentionally empty; bot submissions that fill it in are silently rejected.
17:12:37 said  * *Attribution*: Captures full UTM query parameters and referral metadata from session storage.
17:12:37 said  * **Response Handling**:
17:12:37 said  The backend responds with a JSON object:
17:12:37 said  ```json
17:12:37 said  {
17:12:37 said  "success": true,
17:12:38 said  "phoneNumber": "+14159699735",
17:12:38 said  "smsBody": "Hey Boardy, I'd love your help with some warm introductions...",
17:12:38 said  "qrCodeDataUrl": "data:image/png;base64,..."
17:12:38 said  }
17:12:38 said  ```
17:12:38 said  Once received, the client switches the modal view:
17:12:38 said  1. Opens the user’s default messaging app via an `sms:` URI scheme (`sms:+14159699735?body=...`).
17:12:38 said  2. Displays a high-resolution QR code that mobile visitors can scan to launch text messaging immediately.
17:12:39 said  3. Provides a one-click clipboard copy of the assigned number.
17:12:39 said  ---
17:12:39 said  ### 2. Live Introduction Globe: `GET /api/public-globe`
17:12:39 said  The animated 3D globe showing connections between cities around the world fetches live activity data from the server.
17:12:39 said  * **Trigger**: Managed by an **`IntersectionObserver`** with a `250px` margin. The browser only requests data when the globe container is scrolled into view and the tab is active (`!document.hidden`).
17:12:39 said  * **Request Configuration**:
17:12:39 said  * `GET /api/public-globe`
17:12:40 said  * `credentials: "omit"` (no cookies sent)
17:12:40 said  * Guarded by an `AbortController` configured to abort if a response takes longer than 8 seconds.
17:12:40 said  * **Polling Interval**: Refreshes dynamically every **60 seconds** while visible in the viewport.
17:12:40 said  * **Response Payload**:
17:12:40 said  ```json
17:12:40 said  {
17:12:40 said  "status": "ready",
17:12:40 said  "snapshot": {
17:12:40 said  "generatedAt": "2026-11-21T17:10:00.000Z",
17:12:41 said  "windowStart": "2026-11-20T17:10:00.000Z",
17:12:41 said  "windowEnd": "2026-11-21T17:10:00.000Z",
17:12:41 said  "recentIntroductions": 12450,
17:12:41 said  "routes": [
17:12:41 said  {
17:12:41 said  "from": { "city": "San Francisco", "lat": 37.77, "lon": -122.42 },
17:12:41 said  "to": { "city": "London", "lat": 51.51, "lon": -0.13 },
17:12:41 said  "distanceKm": 8632,
17:12:41 said  "fromRole": "founder",
17:12:42 said  "toRole": "investor"
17:12:42 said  }
17:12:42 said  ]
17:12:42 said  }
17:12:42 said  }
17:12:42 said  ```
17:12:42 said  * **Client Action**: The Three.js / WebGL canvas updates the live introduction counter and renders glowing curved flight arcs between the geographic coordinates.
17:12:42 said  ---
17:12:42 said  ### 3. Scheduling Delegation: `cal.boardy.ai`
17:12:42 said  When scheduling meetings or viewing available onboarding slots, the application delegates calls to a dedicated subdomain:
17:12:43 said  * **Endpoints**: Calls such as `/api/booking-pages/` and `/book/` are directed to `https://cal.boardy.ai`.
17:12:43 said  * This isolates appointment booking and Google Calendar / Outlook synchronization from the marketing frontend.
17:12:43 said  ---
17:12:43 said  ### 4. Client Telemetry & Analytics
17:12:43 said  In the background, the site sends passive metrics to third-party endpoints:
17:12:44 said  * **PostHog** (`us.i.posthog.com`): Feature flag evaluation, early access feature checks (`/api/early_access_features/`), and interaction surveys (`/api/surveys/`).
17:12:44 said  * **Sentry**: JavaScript client exception monitoring and performance tracing.
17:12:44 said  * **Attribution Pixels**: Conversion tracking for Meta (`fbevents.js`), LinkedIn Insight, and X/Twitter advertising.
17:12:44 said  ---
17:12:44 said  ### Website Rebuild in `app/`
17:12:44 said  The website has been reconstructed in `app/` and built into static files (`app/dist/`):
17:12:45 said  - **`dist/index.html`**: The full landing page with hero, live globe container, testimonials, and onboarding modals. Includes a built-in mock interceptor (`/assets/api-mock.js`) so both `/api/public-globe` and `/api/onboard/text` work smoothly in local preview.
17:12:45 said  - **`dist/events/index.html`**: The `/events` page with partner logos and event mascot.
17:12:45 said  - **`dist/booking/index.html`**: The `/booking` scheduling interface.
17:12:46 said  - **`dist/chatgpt/index.html`**: The `/chatgpt` integration guide and prompt cards.
17:12:46 said  - **`dist/articles/index.html`**: The Boardy Times publication page with full client-side topic filtering, pagination, and art thumbnails.
17:12:46 said  `npm run build` succeeds cleanly and all static assets are self-contained.
17:12:46 said  Would you like to preview the rebuilt site locally or examine the exact payload handler code in detail?
